-- title:
--   Transport of pole-chart regularity along an automorphism fixing j, q=2
-- statement:
--   Fix a prime $q$ with $q = 2$, a nonzero natural number $M'$ not divisible by $q$, a field $L$ of characteristic zero, an element $\zeta \in L$ that is a primitive $q$-th root of unity, and assume there is a ring homomorphism $\iota : L \to \mathbb{C}$ with $\iota(\zeta) = \exp(2\pi i/q)$. Let $K$ be an intermediate field of $L \subseteq L((t))$ equal to the $L$-subfield generated by the coefficientwise image of the function field [`ModularCurve.xHFunctionField`](def/ModularCurve_XH.html#L79) of level $q^2M'$ for the subgroup $H \le (\mathbb{Z}/q^2M')^\times$ which is the kernel of reduction $(\mathbb{Z}/q^2M')^\times \to (\mathbb{Z}/q)^\times$, i.e. the units congruent to $1$ modulo $q$. Let $A$ be a discrete valuation domain with an algebra structure on $L$ making $L$ its fraction field, with $q$ in the maximal ideal of $A$ and $\zeta$ in the image of $A$, and let $K$ be an $A$-algebra compatibly with $L$. Let $j \in K$ be nonzero with image in $L((t))$ the coefficientwise image of the $q$-expansion [`ModularCurve.jq`](def/ModularCurve_X0.html#L157), let $\varpi \in A$, and let $\sigma$ be an $L$-algebra automorphism of $K$ with $\sigma(j) = j$. Write $B =$ `chartAlgInf` $A\,K\,j$, the $A$-subalgebra of $K$ of elements integral over $A[j^{-1}]$. Let $Y$ be a prime of $B$ such that for every localisation $C$ of $B$ at $Y$ both $C$ and $C/(\varpi)$ are regular local rings, and let $Y'$ be a prime of $B$ whose elements are exactly the $\sigma$-images of elements of $Y$. Then for every localisation $B_m$ of $B$ at $Y'$, both $B_m$ and $B_m/(\varpi)$ are regular local rings.
--
--   This is the transport of regularity of the $\infty$-chart (pole chart) of the integral model, together with regularity of its special fibre modulo $\varpi$, from a prime $Y$ to its image $\sigma(Y)$ under an $L$-automorphism of the function field fixing $j$; it is the $q = 2$ instance. It feeds the corresponding fibre-regularity statement for the $\infty$-branch of the model of $X_H(q^2M')$.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_FullLevel_isRegularLocalRing_of_isLocalization_atPrime_chartAlgInf_of_algEquiv_apply_eq_xH_of_eq_two.lean

